      <div class="eyebrow">Trader Development Platform</div>
      <h1>Develop the trader <span>behind the trades.</span></h1>
      <p class="sub">KAIZEN is a Trader Development Platform. Set goals, reflect after every session, and turn what you learn into habits that last.</p>
