      <p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:16px">KAIZEN is the platform. You trade, reflect, and track your growth in one calm place. KAIZEN AI sits inside it as your coach.</p>
      <p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:28px">You document the session in plain words. KAIZEN interprets your decisions, connects them to your active goals, and helps you improve one habit at a time.</p>
      <a class="btn gold" href="#join">Join Beta</a>
